                                "sense_id": "2752e9f8-db45-3ced-a7d8-a0a4ba02c716",
                                "text": "Newly ordained priest Fr. Nelson H. Baker was assigned to the parish in 1876 During his time as pastor, Father Baker oversaw the construction of a protectory, infant home, hospital, trade school, and Our Lady of Victory Basilica."
